WEBVTT

01:40.160 --> 01:42.360
Your identity is no longer hidden.

01:43.960 --> 01:45.680
What do you mean to do with

01:46.480 --> 01:48.040
those two disciples of yours?

01:49.360 --> 01:52.560
The fact that we are still alive
is nothing but fortune.

01:54.080 --> 01:55.960
I trust you will not betray us.

01:56.800 --> 01:58.280
And that is because your children

01:59.120 --> 02:00.440
rest in the heavens,

02:01.760 --> 02:02.840
watching over you.

03:04.800 --> 03:07.200
Someone kind crossed paths with you.

03:10.160 --> 03:13.000
They even set polished rice
before an unclaimed memorial tablet.

03:16.040 --> 03:17.200
Chang'an

03:17.720 --> 03:20.200
is indeed a place of deep prosperity.

03:23.120 --> 03:25.600
We have reached the final brink.

03:26.640 --> 03:28.000
Soon, my children,

03:29.360 --> 03:31.200
our answer will come soon.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.760
Thirty years have passed.

03:36.160 --> 03:37.680
When Chang'an falls,

03:38.680 --> 03:40.440
even in the winter,

03:42.120 --> 03:45.000
the people of Tiemo will have more grain
than they could ever finish.

03:58.320 --> 04:01.000
If only you had been born in such times,

04:05.160 --> 04:06.520
how good that would have been.

04:17.000 --> 04:19.160
These past few days
I have felt something is wrong.

04:19.760 --> 04:21.079
Huai'an has not returned.

04:21.800 --> 04:24.040
Around the clinic,
there have been many unfamiliar faces.

04:25.120 --> 04:27.240
All of this was arranged by you.

04:28.400 --> 04:29.440
Why?

04:31.360 --> 04:32.280
Master.

04:34.160 --> 04:35.480
If you mean to kill me,

04:38.560 --> 04:40.440
at least let me die knowing why.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.840
It is a simple truth.

04:45.680 --> 04:47.360
The people of Tiemo have entered the city.

04:53.400 --> 04:54.880
I am Tiemo as well.

05:08.120 --> 05:11.160
Every Tiemo shadow guard in the city
is searching for Xie Huai'an.

05:11.680 --> 05:13.240
He is capable,

05:13.320 --> 05:15.600
and he vanished without a trace.

05:16.240 --> 05:17.680
Fortunately I have you two.

05:18.360 --> 05:20.280
He has very few friends.

05:21.040 --> 05:22.320
For your sake,

05:23.320 --> 05:25.480
he would do anything foolish.

05:37.400 --> 05:39.720
Xiaoqing's life is hanging by a thread.

05:40.840 --> 05:42.040
Do not resist.

05:45.720 --> 05:47.000
Take her away quickly,

05:47.840 --> 05:49.040
and treat her wounds.

05:54.520 --> 05:55.680
Master.

05:55.760 --> 05:56.840
Xiaoqing.

05:57.960 --> 05:59.560
Master.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.600
Xiaoqing.

06:02.680 --> 06:04.440
-What happened to you?
-It hurts.

06:06.040 --> 06:06.920
Do not be afraid.

06:08.160 --> 06:09.520
I am here.

06:12.560 --> 06:13.960
You can only return to the clinic.

06:15.000 --> 06:17.240
There are many of our people
on Xiaocaomen Street.

06:18.400 --> 06:19.800
They will look after you both.

06:31.960 --> 06:33.080
Master.

06:35.520 --> 06:36.920
Must it truly be this way?

06:39.000 --> 06:41.240
For the great cause of Tiemo,

06:42.600 --> 06:45.320
the lives of a child or two taken in

06:47.000 --> 06:48.680
are not worth much.

07:03.560 --> 07:04.680
Xiaoqing.

07:05.280 --> 07:06.320
Let us go home.

07:24.920 --> 07:25.760
Xiaoqing.

07:26.280 --> 07:28.560
Hold on. We are almost at the clinic.

07:30.440 --> 07:31.560
Do not worry.

07:31.640 --> 07:32.640
I will heal you, I promise.

07:36.400 --> 07:39.040
The wounds can be mended.

07:40.840 --> 07:42.800
But what of the heart?

07:44.600 --> 07:45.920
I will kill them for you.

07:49.240 --> 07:50.440
And Master?

07:52.120 --> 07:53.320
Will you kill him too?

08:11.760 --> 08:13.720
UMBRELLAS

10:08.080 --> 10:09.920
You collapsed before Gu Yu's grave.

10:10.760 --> 10:11.920
Our people carried you back.

10:23.160 --> 10:24.480
How many days has it been?

10:25.160 --> 10:26.240
Four days.

10:27.280 --> 10:28.440
The physician examined you.

10:29.320 --> 10:31.120
He said you did not faint from injury

10:31.720 --> 10:32.640
but fell asleep.

10:35.720 --> 10:37.040
Four days.

10:39.080 --> 10:40.720
News of Gu Yu's death

10:42.840 --> 10:45.080
must have reached the north by now.

10:45.680 --> 10:47.000
The death of a general

10:47.800 --> 10:49.280
can shake an army's resolve.

10:51.520 --> 10:52.680
The Baiwenhu Army

10:53.680 --> 10:55.200
may not hold.

10:57.040 --> 10:59.120
Now that the Tiemo forces march south,

10:59.720 --> 11:01.160
what of Chang'an

11:02.960 --> 11:04.520
as it stands today?

11:06.120 --> 11:07.280
Yesterday,

11:08.680 --> 11:10.640
Tiemo troops breached the North Office.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.520
The North Office

11:17.680 --> 11:19.720
is only 1300 li from Chang'an.

11:20.320 --> 11:23.320
The Huben Army excels
at gathering intelligence.

11:23.400 --> 11:27.120
Nothing that happens in Chang'an
escapes your eyes.

11:27.640 --> 11:29.000
Tell me,

11:30.040 --> 11:31.840
my friends…

11:34.520 --> 11:35.840
Are they all dead?

11:37.880 --> 11:38.840
I fear

11:40.040 --> 11:41.560
they may wish they were.

11:45.320 --> 11:46.360
Good.

11:48.560 --> 11:50.000
If so,

11:51.880 --> 11:53.400
then they are still alive.

11:55.280 --> 11:57.120
And if they live, there is hope.

11:58.280 --> 11:59.680
My pageboy…

12:01.640 --> 12:03.120
Where is he now?

12:23.880 --> 12:24.720
You are…

12:31.800 --> 12:33.360
Have we met before?

12:33.440 --> 12:36.760
The last time we met was 15 years ago.

12:37.760 --> 12:40.680
Back then, you were
a young prince of Chang'an,

12:41.720 --> 12:43.560
studying at the Grand Academy.

12:43.640 --> 12:45.520
To shirk your lessons,

12:45.600 --> 12:47.960
you often claimed to be ill.

12:50.480 --> 12:51.680
You are…

12:53.640 --> 12:55.160
After all these years,

12:56.120 --> 12:58.320
there is something I have always wondered.

12:59.440 --> 13:01.200
The gift I gave you…

13:02.640 --> 13:04.280
Did you ever use it?

13:06.680 --> 13:08.520
I have a gift for you.

13:31.680 --> 13:32.760
Mentor.

13:33.280 --> 13:34.120
Wu Zhongheng?

13:34.200 --> 13:35.600
It is me.

13:39.080 --> 13:40.080
Who are you, truly?

13:41.320 --> 13:43.880
Xie Huai'an did not have time
to tell you, I suppose.

13:44.920 --> 13:46.320
I am Tiemo.

13:47.560 --> 13:49.800
All of Chang'an speaks of Gu Yu's death.

13:50.320 --> 13:51.480
Yes.

13:52.360 --> 13:53.800
I was the one who killed him.

13:57.160 --> 13:58.520
Do not be alarmed.

14:00.080 --> 14:01.400
I will not kill you.

14:02.880 --> 14:05.640
Sit. Let us speak of old times.

14:10.520 --> 14:11.600
Come. Sit.

14:21.960 --> 14:24.160
How long have you been hiding?

14:27.680 --> 14:28.840
More than 20 years.

14:30.440 --> 14:33.520
I traveled across your entire land,

14:34.920 --> 14:37.640
then spent a few more years
building a reputation,

14:38.160 --> 14:39.560
befriending the powerful.

14:40.160 --> 14:42.000
Liu Ziwen, Yan Fengshan,

14:42.520 --> 14:44.160
Grand Preceptor Cen Weizong,

14:44.680 --> 14:48.680
even your father
were all good friends of mine.

14:48.760 --> 14:50.800
During my years at the Grand Academy,

14:51.600 --> 14:54.240
I saw for myself
the brightest talents of Chang'an.

14:54.320 --> 14:56.520
Xie Huai'an, Gu Yu,

14:57.280 --> 14:58.920
and your elder brother,

14:59.640 --> 15:00.680
Xiao Wuyang.

15:01.640 --> 15:02.920
And you

15:04.400 --> 15:06.600
were the most timid of them all.

15:12.160 --> 15:13.760
You are not the first
to say that about me.

15:14.440 --> 15:15.520
Once,

15:16.880 --> 15:18.320
Yan Fengshan said the same thing.

15:19.640 --> 15:21.680
Do not pity yourself.

15:22.880 --> 15:24.560
Because it is precisely your timidity

15:26.120 --> 15:29.720
that makes you
the ideal candidate for the throne.

15:30.240 --> 15:32.800
Many who hold power think so.

15:33.880 --> 15:34.960
And so do

15:35.720 --> 15:37.240
the faraway people of Tiemo,

15:37.320 --> 15:40.040
those who serve at the altar
on Mount Shiluoman.

15:40.920 --> 15:41.960
You see,

15:42.480 --> 15:46.200
timidity can sometimes be
a means of survival.

15:47.040 --> 15:49.840
It allows you to live
far longer than most.

15:50.520 --> 15:51.640
Take Gu Yu,

15:52.240 --> 15:54.880
a man who always charged to the front.

15:55.720 --> 15:57.960
Men like him only die first.

16:01.400 --> 16:02.400
By the way,

16:03.680 --> 16:05.000
was it

16:05.600 --> 16:09.640
Xie Huai'an's idea to send you away?

16:23.040 --> 16:24.920
You were born into the imperial line,

16:25.560 --> 16:27.280
yet you scare so easily.

16:28.080 --> 16:30.880
Yan Fengshan kept you
under his thumb for years.

16:31.800 --> 16:33.800
The throne slipped
from your grasp long ago.

16:34.320 --> 16:36.480
But in the great city of Chang'an,

16:36.560 --> 16:39.400
he is hardly the only one
who wants to become another Yan Fengshan.

16:40.200 --> 16:42.120
Whoever grows powerful

16:43.080 --> 16:44.440
will try to control you.

16:44.960 --> 16:46.320
And this truth

16:47.200 --> 16:49.680
is something
Xie Huai'an certainly understands.

16:54.480 --> 16:57.040
He should have killed
you the moment he had you

16:57.840 --> 16:59.080
under control.

16:59.680 --> 17:01.560
If peace is what he wanted,

17:02.160 --> 17:04.520
your death would have settled everything.

17:12.960 --> 17:14.359
He is more human

17:15.200 --> 17:17.680
than you or Yan Fengshan ever were.

17:17.760 --> 17:18.640
Indeed.

17:19.240 --> 17:20.720
You threw snakes at him back then,

17:20.800 --> 17:23.000
yet he can still call you friend.

17:23.599 --> 17:26.400
He truly has a kindness
that serves him little.

17:35.320 --> 17:36.640
When I entered Chang'an,

17:38.080 --> 17:39.680
my first move against the Huben Army

17:42.040 --> 17:44.000
was to give him a new face

17:45.560 --> 17:46.880
and a forged identity,

17:49.040 --> 17:50.520
fooling everyone.

17:51.840 --> 17:53.960
Even Yan Fengshan

17:54.480 --> 17:56.080
might never have guessed it.

18:02.720 --> 18:04.480
What I did not expect

18:05.440 --> 18:06.720
was that this plan

18:08.080 --> 18:10.200
would be uncovered by the King of Tiemo.

18:11.960 --> 18:14.080
Zhu Zhilong is Tiemo as well.

18:16.040 --> 18:17.720
It turns out

18:18.960 --> 18:21.680
they had infiltrated us
long before we knew it.

18:25.200 --> 18:27.760
My poor friends, both of them.

18:43.040 --> 18:44.160
I want to go out.

18:49.360 --> 18:50.880
Do you know where you are?

19:03.440 --> 19:04.840
Of course I do.

19:08.760 --> 19:11.040
This was once my sister's home.

19:22.680 --> 19:24.920
The pear tree in the courtyard

19:27.000 --> 19:28.760
was planted by her own hand.

19:32.320 --> 19:33.560
To me,

19:34.160 --> 19:36.160
this is where the general lived

19:38.840 --> 19:40.560
and where he died.

19:44.560 --> 19:46.320
Perhaps people like us

19:48.160 --> 19:49.320
are fated

19:50.160 --> 19:52.320
to choose in the midst of chaos

19:55.160 --> 19:56.640
between vengeance

19:58.000 --> 19:59.080
and duty to the realm.

20:00.680 --> 20:02.320
You do not need to choose.

20:03.880 --> 20:05.640
I have already given you my word.

20:06.760 --> 20:09.160
When the Tiemo are defeated,

20:10.960 --> 20:13.480
you may come to settle your debt
with me at any time.

20:14.000 --> 20:15.120
And in doing so,

20:15.640 --> 20:19.320
you will honor the Huben Army
and General Fengshan.

20:34.280 --> 20:35.720
With the general gone,

20:35.800 --> 20:37.600
the Huben I can command is limited.

20:38.360 --> 20:39.800
But if you fight the Tiemo,

20:40.880 --> 20:42.000
I will help you.

20:44.760 --> 20:45.800
For now,

20:47.160 --> 20:49.000
I need time to think.

20:52.560 --> 20:53.640
I said

20:55.440 --> 20:57.040
I want to go out for a walk.

20:58.560 --> 21:00.600
Before he died, Yan Fengshan said

21:01.800 --> 21:03.240
that the streets of Chang'an

21:05.000 --> 21:07.280
might offer a different view.

21:08.840 --> 21:10.480
Then tomorrow,

21:11.240 --> 21:13.760
walk around Chang'an.

21:13.840 --> 21:16.080
Chang'an

21:16.840 --> 21:19.680
can be beautiful at times.

21:41.680 --> 21:42.640
I will leave this for you.

21:44.040 --> 21:45.040
Let us look over there.

21:50.600 --> 21:51.800
Steamed buns.

22:00.480 --> 22:03.920
‎FFENG'S CURED HAM SHOP,
‎EIGHT-DIRECTIONS GOODS SHOP

22:44.200 --> 22:45.320
Huai'an.

22:57.440 --> 22:59.400
An army may fall to the last man.

23:00.800 --> 23:02.160
But Chang'an

23:03.200 --> 23:04.400
must not fall.

24:13.840 --> 24:15.440
This is Gu Yu's

24:16.320 --> 24:18.440
battle report that he hid inside his body.

24:19.280 --> 24:20.440
Once you read it,

24:20.960 --> 24:22.520
you will know where you must go.

24:29.120 --> 24:31.520
Right now my friends' fate is unknown

24:32.120 --> 24:33.560
and I have no one else to trust,

24:34.360 --> 24:36.000
so I can only leave it in your hands.

24:38.520 --> 24:40.440
But if you have other plans,

24:41.720 --> 24:43.920
you are free to choose another path.

24:45.280 --> 24:46.960
But I fear that Chang'an

24:48.840 --> 24:50.520
can no longer be held.

25:00.200 --> 25:02.960
I will deliver this to where it must go.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.160
Thank you.

25:19.640 --> 25:21.480
Is there any news of Xiao Wuyang?

25:25.560 --> 25:26.800
There has been no word at all.

25:29.080 --> 25:30.200
What are you planning to do?

25:32.720 --> 25:33.920
You mean to head north.

25:34.440 --> 25:35.480
Gu Yu is dead.

25:36.080 --> 25:37.760
I have no allies left to rely on.

25:38.280 --> 25:40.760
The deposed emperor and Ye Zheng
are both in their hands.

25:44.440 --> 25:46.120
The Tiemo are waiting for me.

25:47.800 --> 25:49.480
This is the only road left to me.

25:51.680 --> 25:53.120
I will go to the Tiemo,

25:54.040 --> 25:55.760
and help them kill Xiao Wuyang.

26:00.640 --> 26:01.800
In the imperial court,

26:02.760 --> 26:06.120
the ones the Tiemo fear most
are Yan Fengshan and Xiao Wuyang.

26:07.320 --> 26:09.240
Now that Yan Fengshan is dead,

26:10.680 --> 26:12.440
our only chance

26:14.040 --> 26:15.680
lies with Xiao Wuyang.

27:06.920 --> 27:08.240
You should go.

27:10.200 --> 27:11.360
And you

27:11.880 --> 27:13.000
had better not die.

27:13.520 --> 27:15.440
You owe no debt of life to the Tiemo.

27:15.520 --> 27:17.240
You owe it to General Fengshan.

27:17.320 --> 27:18.680
I owe him nothing.

27:19.600 --> 27:20.680
Go.

27:25.560 --> 27:26.400
Take care.

29:51.520 --> 29:52.600
Father.

29:55.560 --> 29:57.360
I failed to protect my sister.

30:00.080 --> 30:01.400
No one walks away

30:02.320 --> 30:03.440
unscathed

30:04.400 --> 30:06.240
after facing Yan Fengshan.

30:07.080 --> 30:08.720
You guarded her all these years

30:09.240 --> 30:10.400
and did everything you could.

30:11.440 --> 30:12.560
In the end,

30:12.640 --> 30:14.320
you even avenged her.

30:14.840 --> 30:16.680
Do not be so hard on yourself.

30:19.880 --> 30:23.720
Seeing my son so weak and worn

30:25.440 --> 30:26.440
breaks my heart.

30:28.640 --> 30:30.120
A father

30:31.200 --> 30:32.880
always aches for his child.

30:35.160 --> 30:36.720
Since you came to Chang'an,

30:37.800 --> 30:39.560
you have already lost too much.

30:40.760 --> 30:42.280
Then take the red ribbon down.

30:44.920 --> 30:45.760
Father.

30:47.800 --> 30:49.360
Though our family's vengeance is repaid,

30:50.960 --> 30:52.320
Chang'an

30:54.560 --> 30:56.240
is far from peaceful.

31:16.200 --> 31:17.840
I waited all night.

31:19.280 --> 31:21.640
I only wished to tell
you one thing, Father.

31:24.840 --> 31:26.720
The King of Tiemo has arrived in Chang'an.

31:40.840 --> 31:42.680
Then take the red ribbon down.

31:48.400 --> 31:49.480
Very well.

32:29.080 --> 32:30.720
I didn't dare come

32:30.800 --> 32:32.160
until everything was settled.

32:32.920 --> 32:34.200
Xie Huai'an's friends

32:34.720 --> 32:36.240
can no longer escape.

32:36.760 --> 32:37.880
We need only wait for him to show.

32:40.680 --> 32:43.440
White Hair entered
Yan Fengshan's courtyard.

32:44.600 --> 32:46.920
I cannot tell whether he won or lost,

32:47.560 --> 32:49.400
so I sent you in.

32:49.480 --> 32:51.200
For that,

32:51.280 --> 32:54.080
you had to kill
the master you served for years.

32:55.600 --> 32:56.600
Do you regret it?

32:57.280 --> 32:58.280
No.

33:01.720 --> 33:03.840
I have only ever
served one master with my life.

33:08.080 --> 33:10.080
Yan Fengshan is dead.

33:10.840 --> 33:12.520
The Huben Army is no longer a threat.

33:13.520 --> 33:15.040
Gu Yu is dead as well.

33:15.680 --> 33:17.000
Our forces

33:17.080 --> 33:19.720
can march straight
into the heart of their empire.

33:20.320 --> 33:22.160
Only one danger remains.

33:22.680 --> 33:24.280
Xiao Wuyang.

33:25.080 --> 33:26.320
If he dies,

33:27.840 --> 33:28.960
Chang'an will fall.

33:30.520 --> 33:33.280
Xiao Wuyang stands alone now.

33:33.880 --> 33:36.840
This time, if our plan is thorough,

33:37.640 --> 33:38.800
he will not survive.

33:41.360 --> 33:44.680
I saw something like this once,
a man on the edge of death,

33:47.080 --> 33:49.240
hanging high on a platform.

33:49.320 --> 33:50.960
He was an ordinary man,

33:51.040 --> 33:53.760
yet he lived for seven days and nights.

33:54.800 --> 33:57.760
If someone ordinary
can fight so hard to survive,

33:59.200 --> 34:01.960
what about the King of Death, Xiao Wuyang?

34:03.520 --> 34:04.720
Yes.

34:04.800 --> 34:06.480
The noodles are here.

34:10.760 --> 34:12.480
Chili oil noodles.

34:13.639 --> 34:15.520
Scallions dipped in vinegar.

34:17.560 --> 34:19.159
It has been more than ten years.

34:19.239 --> 34:20.719
Sha,

34:21.520 --> 34:23.239
you still remember my favorite bite.

34:23.920 --> 34:24.880
Of course I do.

34:25.679 --> 34:28.040
Had I forgotten,

34:29.120 --> 34:30.600
I would have lost my head.

34:37.080 --> 34:38.480
Sha,

34:39.960 --> 34:41.960
Cen Pickles came by, didn't he?

34:46.080 --> 34:47.040
No.

34:47.760 --> 34:50.080
After the Liu clan was wiped out,

34:50.159 --> 34:52.400
Yan Fengshan purged Liu's faction,

34:52.480 --> 34:55.120
and he never showed himself again.

34:56.080 --> 34:58.480
Does he still need to hide
from Yan Fengshan's blade?

34:59.080 --> 35:00.360
Don't you also…

35:09.680 --> 35:12.960
Don't you also hide from him?
Unbelievable.

35:18.600 --> 35:19.600
Sha,

35:20.200 --> 35:23.000
that you've survived this long
with that temperament

35:23.080 --> 35:25.040
feels like a miracle to me.

35:25.880 --> 35:27.640
Eat while it's hot.

35:27.720 --> 35:28.920
Sha,

35:30.520 --> 35:32.240
in this world,

35:34.160 --> 35:36.120
I have patience for very few people.

35:37.280 --> 35:38.280
You are one of them.

35:39.200 --> 35:40.880
Cen Pickles is the other.

35:42.160 --> 35:43.680
If he came to you,

35:43.760 --> 35:46.880
and you don't wish to tell me,
or he forbade you to say,

35:46.960 --> 35:48.240
it doesn't matter.

35:48.760 --> 35:50.640
Just pass on a message for me.

35:51.440 --> 35:53.360
Tell him I have arrived in Chang'an.

35:54.680 --> 35:56.000
And tell him I hope

35:56.520 --> 35:57.920
we are still friends.

36:40.200 --> 36:41.600
Cen Pickles,

36:43.200 --> 36:44.400
who is he?

36:46.520 --> 36:48.080
A man surnamed Cen.

36:49.320 --> 36:50.880
Twenty years ago,

36:50.960 --> 36:52.240
everyone knew his name.

36:54.400 --> 36:56.400
The Grand Preceptor, Cen Weizong?

36:58.480 --> 37:00.280
He was a friend of His Majesty?

37:06.360 --> 37:07.360
The founding emperor,

37:07.880 --> 37:08.840
Liu Ziwen,

37:09.880 --> 37:11.320
the Grand Preceptor Cen Weizong,

37:11.400 --> 37:12.840
and the man just now,

37:13.360 --> 37:15.600
when they were young, often gathered here.

37:17.840 --> 37:19.080
Yan Fengshan

37:19.600 --> 37:21.680
would sometimes come along too.

37:21.760 --> 37:24.400
He was younger than the rest of them.

37:25.760 --> 37:27.160
And in their eyes,

37:28.080 --> 37:29.960
the so-called General Fengshan

37:31.160 --> 37:33.040
was just an inexperienced young man.

37:37.280 --> 37:39.480
An inexperienced young man?

37:51.560 --> 37:52.800
Later,

37:53.960 --> 37:56.200
didn't he rule the empire
for over ten years?

37:56.280 --> 37:57.920
In your eyes,

38:01.120 --> 38:03.080
I am also an inexperienced young man,
aren't I?

38:12.040 --> 38:13.080
You…

38:19.160 --> 38:20.280
You are not human.

38:26.240 --> 38:28.440
When I had nowhere left to go,

38:28.520 --> 38:30.600
the boss took me in.

38:33.560 --> 38:34.800
Later,

38:35.840 --> 38:38.600
I went outside the city
to collect his body.

38:45.120 --> 38:46.720
He was crushed to death.

39:01.280 --> 39:03.680
Not even beasts would do such a thing.

39:22.400 --> 39:24.160
I remember the boss's kindness.

39:29.360 --> 39:31.720
But I was born a Tiemo man.

39:34.240 --> 39:36.080
My life was not his to give.

39:57.760 --> 39:59.440
Can I have a bowl of noodles?

40:06.920 --> 40:08.040
Get out.

40:48.480 --> 40:49.640
After more than ten years apart,

40:50.920 --> 40:52.400
I meet you again.

40:58.120 --> 41:00.080
This is Yang Chuhao's courtyard.

41:01.000 --> 41:04.360
Why did you suddenly
decide to sun his books?

41:09.480 --> 41:12.680
In his study,
there truly are many fine volumes.

41:13.280 --> 41:16.200
I even found a travelogue
written by a friend

41:16.280 --> 41:17.880
from my youth.

41:17.960 --> 41:19.720
Reading it

41:20.240 --> 41:22.040
was like meeting an old friend again.

41:26.320 --> 41:27.400
An old friend?

41:28.760 --> 41:30.480
Then I am also one of your old friends.

41:30.560 --> 41:32.360
Of course.

41:36.920 --> 41:38.920
At the Grand Academy, I once asked you,

41:39.840 --> 41:41.200
when you grew up,

41:41.280 --> 41:43.480
what kind of achievement you wished for.

41:44.080 --> 41:45.520
Do you remember?

41:48.080 --> 41:49.520
Of course I do.

41:50.360 --> 41:53.200
I asked you, when you grew up,

41:53.280 --> 41:55.720
what kind of career you wished to build?

41:56.400 --> 41:58.560
In times of peace, to aid a wise ruler.

41:59.240 --> 42:01.000
And in times of chaos?

42:01.080 --> 42:02.400
In times of chaos,

42:02.480 --> 42:03.840
to kill every enemy.

42:09.360 --> 42:10.640
White Hair,

42:12.800 --> 42:14.560
have you come to kill me?

42:22.560 --> 42:23.760
Mentor,

42:23.840 --> 42:25.760
these hands of a scholar

42:26.920 --> 42:28.680
now hold no iron, no blade.

42:29.480 --> 42:31.840
How could they possibly
kill the King of Tiemo?

42:32.360 --> 42:33.760
I came

42:34.920 --> 42:37.240
to trade for my friend's life.

42:37.840 --> 42:39.880
You say you came to save a friend,

42:41.240 --> 42:44.080
but I do not believe
you would bow your head so readily.

42:44.680 --> 42:46.120
It has been over ten years,

42:47.360 --> 42:49.920
and your intellect alone
is enough to chill one's bones.

42:50.520 --> 42:52.600
You killed Yan Fengshan with strategy,

42:53.880 --> 42:55.800
because you understood him.

42:57.320 --> 42:58.520
White Hair,

43:01.760 --> 43:02.880
as for me,

43:04.560 --> 43:06.120
how well do you understand me?
